msg
@match *
You have entered the CINERARIUM DRACONIS of NAVAR.
State your PURPOSE.

@match purpose
You were sent here by the HALL OF THE PRESERVED WING.
That alone earns you a MISSION.

@match mission
There is a dragon nest lost to time, hidden in the CAVES north-east of STONEVILLE.

@match stoneville
Stoneville was once closer to dragonfire than it admits.
Beneath its lands, the earth still remembers.

@match caves
These CAVES are unmarked and partially collapsed.
They were sealed at the end of the SCORNIAN WAR.

@match egg
One EGG is rumored to remain, entombed deep beneath stone and ash.
It was never hatched. Never shattered.

@match buried
The EGG lies beyond sight. You will need to DIG.

@match dig
Bring a SHOVEL. The ground there is dense, layered, and resistant.
Hands and weapons will fail you.

@match shovel
If you lack a SHOVEL, acquire one before you leave.
Without it, this task is impossible.

@match return
Return with whatever you uncover?FRAGMENTS, SHELL, or confirmation of absence.
All findings are valuable.

@match reward
You will earn ACCESS to restricted records, and your name will be entered into the ARCHIVE.

@match bye
Go now. The earth grows impatient when remembered.
endmsg
